{
  "title": "ApplicationAssets",
  "description": "The application's assets: the asset types it can load, and assets it owns for its whole lifetime. Assets loaded here stay resident until the application is destroyed. Load scene assets through `scene.assets` instead, and shorter-lived groups through a scope from createScope.",
